BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:English Conversation Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T191500
UID:6a80af09aafa6100295cd737@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Practice speaking English with a friendly group\, led by a lib
 rarian. Meet new people\, improve your English language conversation skill
 s\, and build your confidence in a fun and relaxed setting. This program i
 s for those whose first language is not English. This is a drop-in program
 \, registration is not required.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, First floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a80af09aafa6100295cd737
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Housing Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T163000
UID:69583000c719ac98c335c8cf@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and work one-on-one with staff from The Housing Help C
 entre (THHC) to determine your housing needs\, connect you to other govern
 ment services\, and to match you with landlords across the city. THHC work
 s with both individuals and families in the City of Toronto to find and ma
 intain affordable\, safe housing.\nTHHC can be contacted at 416-285-8070.
LOCATION:Malvern
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69583000c719ac98c335c8cf
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
