BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Access to Housing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260923T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260923T160000
UID:6a3c343bc7d3cd580062952b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you seeking housing support or have questions about afford
 able housing options? Join us at S. Walter Stewart Library for personalize
 d\, one-on-one assistance with a Housing Services Worker.\nEast York Housi
 ng Help Hub is offering information session on the Rent Geared to Income o
 ptions available in\nMyAccesstoHousingTO\nonline system. Housing staff wil
 l support program participants with hands-on supports and help them comple
 te the registration process.\nFor more information or to register please c
 ontact East York Housing Help Hub at 416 698-9306 or email eyhhc@eyetfrp
 .ca.
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3c343bc7d3cd580062952b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friday Night Movies - Beetlejuice Beetlejuice
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T180000
UID:6a986d3757c264087ad5c381@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This month's movie:\nBeetlejuice Beetlejuice\nThis movie is ra
 ted PG\nBeetlejuice is back! After an unexpected family tragedy\, three ge
 nerations of the Deetz family return home to Winter River. Still haunted b
 y Beetlejuice\, Lydia's life is turned upside down when her rebellious tee
 nage daughter\, Astrid\, discovers the mysterious model of the town in the
  attic and the portal to the Afterlife is accidentally opened. With troubl
 e brewing in both realms\, it's only a matter of time until someone says B
 eetlejuice's name three times and the mischievous demon returns to unleash
  his very own brand of mayhem.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a986d3757c264087ad5c381
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coffee and Conversation with Ombudsman Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T150000
UID:6a3d873e48c98c3600a25dbc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization.\nThis month we will be joined by\nOmbudsman Toront
 o.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient 
 lists will be available at the program.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Front Entrance
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3d873e48c98c3600a25dbc
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
