BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Housing Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260922T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260922T163000
UID:69583000c719ac98c335c8d1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and work one-on-one with staff from The Housing Help C
 entre (THHC) to determine your housing needs\, connect you to other govern
 ment services\, and to match you with landlords across the city. THHC work
 s with both individuals and families in the City of Toronto to find and ma
 intain affordable\, safe housing.\nTHHC can be contacted at 416-285-8070.
LOCATION:Malvern
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69583000c719ac98c335c8d1
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sanko Speaks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261202T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261202T200000
UID:6a987af8e1fb8f13578ba608@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A free\, culturally affirming drop-in program for adults that 
 promotes mental wellness through creative activities\, discussion\, and he
 althy coping strategies. Guided by the concept of Sankofa\, participants e
 xplore connections between past experiences and present wellbeing while bu
 ilding skills for managing stress and supporting mental health. Activities
  vary based on community interests and needs.\nThis program is in collabor
 ation with TAIBU Community Health Centre.
LOCATION:Malvern
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a987af8e1fb8f13578ba608
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
