BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LSP: English Conversation Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260905T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260905T140000
UID:6a6648bc0d65ac360042576d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join our English Conversation Circle\, a friendly space where 
 newcomers can practice speaking English and build confidence. It is open t
 o beginner and intermediate learners\, and we focus on everyday conversati
 ons\, useful vocabulary\, and simple activities. It’s a great way to mee
 t new people and feel more connected to your community.\nNote: This is not
  a formal language class. Refreshments will be served.\nIn partnership wit
 h Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, TNO - The Neighbourhood 
 Organization & Toronto Public Library.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a6648bc0d65ac360042576d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Runnymede Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261009T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261009T150000
UID:6a90998c3b6c71003e5bd77d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively discussion of Shehan Karunatilaka's\nThe 
 Seven Moons of Maali Almeida\nWinner of the 2022 Booker Prize\, this novel
  is a searing\, mordantly funny satire set amid the murderous mayhem of a 
 Sri Lanka beset by civil war.\nDrop-in.
LOCATION:Runnymede\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a90998c3b6c71003e5bd77d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Night Tech Support Drop-in
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261001T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261001T200000
UID:6a85cd564c610f00389551e1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have questions about your tablet\, phone\, laptop\, email or a
 n app? Need help with eBooks or other online library services?\nWe know ke
 eping up with new technology can be difficult! Our staff are here to teach
  you technology tools and concepts in a friendly and casual setting. Pleas
 e bring your personal device and any questions you may have.\n*Longer ques
 tions may be referred to a 1 hour Book a Librarian appointment at a later 
 date.*\n*No technology repairs at this event.*
LOCATION:Guildwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a85cd564c610f00389551e1
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
