BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CRA Tax Information Session for Self-employed Small Business Owner
 s (T1)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T203000
UID:6a96f4e42dac6e00372337b1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This Canada Revenue Agency presentation is for unincorporated 
 small business owners and self-employed individuals looking for free tax h
 elp.\nA CRA Liaison Officer will cover:\n- Business tax deductions\n- Comm
 on tax errors\n- Helpful tools and services offered by the CRA\n- General 
 bookkeeping concepts and best practices\n***\nThis 2-hour program is held 
 online via CRA's MS Teams. Please register to receive information on how t
 o attend (an event reminder email will be sent approximately 24 hours 
 before the event begins).\nThis program will not be recorded. Captions wil
 l be available.\n***\nAdditional CRA Info Sessions\nWe also offer an addi
 tional CRA Tax Information Session for Self-employed Small Business Owners
  (T1) on\nThursday\, October 15\, 2026 - 12:00 to 2:00 pm\n.\nLooking for 
 a CRA info session for small corporations (T2)? We also offer them on:\nTu
 esday\, October 20\, 2026 - 6:30 to 8:30 pm\nThursday\, October 22\, 2026 
 - 12:00 to 2:00 pm\nNeed help with MS Teams?\nJoining a Teams Meeting\nInf
 ormation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is coll
 ected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, secti
 ons 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event
  and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how t
 he library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at
 \nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2
 G8.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a96f4e42dac6e00372337b1
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
