DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T160000
UID:6a8f621e57c264087ad40f25@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join the Scarborough Poetry Club for "Imagine Peace: Poetry Fo
 r a World Beyond War". Featuring readings by Jeevan Bhagwat\, League of Ca
 nadian Poets\, and members of the Scarborough Poetry Club. Facilitated by 
 Anna Nieminen\, Poetry Curator.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe perso
