DESCRIPTION:This workshop is designed to help newcomers build better habit
 s as they navigate their new environment. Participants will receive tips a
 nd strategies to develop consistent\, effective routines that are tailored
  to their new life in Canada.\nBy the end of this workshop\, participants 
 will have actionable insights to enhance their productivity and manage the
 ir time efficiently to stay organized\, focused\, and productive\, while m
 aintaining their overall well-being and work-life balance.\nThis program i
 s part of Small Business Month and the Newcomer Entrepreneurship Initiativ
 e.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form 
 is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\
 , sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used fo
