UID:6a8d9d8969166f088b94af38@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Arts department of the Toronto Reference Library presents 
 a screening of Perfect Days.\nPerfect Days is a 2023 drama film directed b
 y Wim Wenders. It tells the story of Hirayama\, a middle-aged man living a
  quiet\, deeply structured life in Tokyo. He works as a cleaner for the ci
 ty's public restrooms\, but finds profound contentment and grace in his si
 mple daily routines.\nFilm rating: 14+\nLength: 2H 4M\nFilm starts at 2pm 
 sharp\nFilm is in Japanese with English subtitles
