SUMMARY:Creating a Landing Page: Tell Your Story and Track Your Customers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T200000
UID:6a99bb084995480655ed74ce@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:You don't need a full website when you're getting started with
  a new business\, one page can get the job done. This session covers what 
 a landing page should contain\, how to attract customers\, and how to info
 rm them about your product. During the session\, we will look at free tool
 s that don't require coding knowledge\, learn how to collect emails\, and 
 learn how to assess if a business page is functioning correctly.\nRegistra
 tion recommended. Drop-ins welcomed until room capacity is full.\nInformat
 ion Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected
  by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 2
 0(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and 
