 rtistic vision\, enhanced by imagery and puppets from the production.\nQ&A
  to follow. Books available for purchase.\nAbout this event’s guests:\nS
 andra Laronde\nAparita Bhandari\nRead more:\nShe Holds up the Stars\n***\n
