 rin/St. Clair branch each month\, or place your own hold to have a copy se
 nt to your closest branch.\nAugust:\nThe Covenant of Water\nby Abraham Ve
 rghese\nSeptember:\nThe Corrections\nby Jonathan Frazen\nOctober:\nThe Edi
 ble Woman\nby Margaret Atwood\nNovember:\nSlammerkin\nby Emma Donoghue\nD
 ecember:\nWhat We Can Know\nby Ian McEwan
