 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community. Each month we will be joined by a different c
 ommunity organization.\nThe guest for this month will be\nEpilepsy Toronto
 \n.\nIt is a non-profit organization that provides free support\, counsell
 ing\, and educational services to individuals living with epilepsy and sei
 zure disorders\, as well as their families.\nSnacks and refreshments are p
 rovided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the pr
